{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id101825847"}, "name":{"label":"Murkee"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-16T09:03:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"14557073412"}, "title":{"label":"Useful"}, "content":{"label":"But no new features since nov 2025\n\n... let me group reminders and timers.\n\n1) start/stop a whole set of timers\n\nI.e. i might be doing a timed exercise , and want an alarm at the end, and also warnings along the way\n\n2) postpone/complete a *group* of reminders. \n\n- I have 30 reminders for a working week, it is a lot of editing to take a week off. Let me just say “restart this group on ‘date’”\n\n3) let me specify a device for an alert\n\nI.e.alert ONLY on iphone/ipad/macos or a combination (but editable on all). For my work alarms, i never want them on the ipad at home with my partner", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id220423257"}, "name":{"label":"M L 1972"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-17T11:43:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.4.2"}, "id":{"label":"14194496292"}, "title":{"label":"Using for a decade"}, "content":{"label":"This app is great, not just for reminders but also on old logged reminders. I know what I was doing from 2012, every day with all the issues that you don’t need to remember at the time but can be extremely handy in hindsight.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id8484001"}, "name":{"label":"tduk"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-25T04:13:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.4"}, "id":{"label":"14103949006"}, "title":{"label":"Really well executed app"}, "content":{"label":"Really nicely done app. The way you can schedule events with natural language is nice, the various notification and delay options are great, and it feels like the developer really cared about creating a great experience. \n\nFor years I’ve used my calendar as a todo list for important things, adding events when I think I might tackle it, but it’s a pain to keep on top of and if you miss an event you have to remember to manually reschedule. This app is basically the structure version of that workflow - items have times (super easy to enter), it reminds you at the time and also makes it trivial to defer by whatever time unit you like. \n\nMy one very slight nit is I would love an option to use the standard iOS system font. The one it uses is fine and easy to read, I just like things to look consistent in general. But that’s a minor issue with an otherwise great app. Nice work.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
