{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id42060184"}, "name":{"label":"hdotnet"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-03T12:22:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"25.8"}, "id":{"label":"13590915652"}, "title":{"label":"excellent app. cuts thru the noise, persistent and useful"}, "content":{"label":"3 months in. I never got anything done until I got this app. Its design is beautifully minimalist while staying very powerful. When you swipe to ignore a reminder you are guaranteed to get reminded again, constantly until you actually get it done. You might find that annoying [dig in the settings and ux, it’s adjustable], but it’s exactly what I need in my mental life. Happily paid for it, the dev is on the right track and continues to smash out useful updates that are explained in detail.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id520838045"}, "name":{"label":"Marsmite"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-08T08:50:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"25.4"}, "id":{"label":"13240457642"}, "title":{"label":"So good."}, "content":{"label":"It's an oldie but it's unbeaten.\n\nThat said, I would really like a watch complication that immediately launches a voice input interface for adding tasks. Nothing else. Just that. No task app I know of has this.\n\nSiri is no good for this because it intercepts anything it can identify as a task and puts it into Reminders or Calendar. As such, any voice interface needs to parse the input itself.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
