{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id194966232"}, "name":{"label":"AdsoSebastio"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-05-16T03:09:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.4"}, "id":{"label":"9932253115"}, "title":{"label":"Love the app! Have one suggestion…"}, "content":{"label":"I want to first say that I absolutely love this app and use it every day. One addition I would love to see: On the Apple Watch, when you add the complication to a face it only says ‘1 due’ or ‘2 due’ etc. Could you add the ability to see the actual reminders when you glance at the face rather than having to click into the app? Obviously there is limited space so if you had 3+ reminders you may not see them all but atleast the first two would be super helpful!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
