{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id42460881"}, "name":{"label":"davidjohnbird"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-05-02T03:43:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.3"}, "id":{"label":"9884297295"}, "title":{"label":"For when you need reminding"}, "content":{"label":"Don’t believe it when they say there’s less to do once you retire and the years start adding up. Remembering all the things to do - one offs and recurring - can get difficult. I know. That’s where the Due app comes to the rescue. Used it for years now, and life’s a lot easier. Every ping and ding that Due sounds - something else to do, something else done. And if you can’t get it done today, Due will let you reschedule. Just don’t reschedule too many times and you’ll be fine. It has to be my most used app. If there is one thing that would be nice - a notes field for each reminder. Then I could add in all my gardening tasks. Highly recommended app nonetheless.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
